    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 21.312125,
      "end": 33.09466666666667,
      "lesson_progress": 0.25,
      "text": "Success criteria. I can repeat the test and record steps. I can record pairs only for exact division. I can stop before factor pairs repeat.",
      "chapter": "Success Criteria: I can…",
