    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 56.052375,
      "end": 67.62045833333333,
      "lesson_progress": 0.4166666666666667,
      "text": "For thirty-six, test one, two, three and four. They produce partners thirty-six, eighteen, twelve and nine. Five leaves a remainder, so do not record it.",
